{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13638","headline":"余姚祗役奉简鲍参军 · 严维","name":"余姚祗役奉简鲍参军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"童年献赋在皇州，方寸思量君与侯。\n万事无成新白首，两春虚掷对沧流。\n歌诗盛赋文星动，箫管新亭晦日游。\n知己欲依何水部，乡人今正贱东丘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}